// needs: threads net
// expect-exit: 0
// expect-stdout:
// pss, sha-256 only: hello
// pss, any hash: hello
// config rsa: ok
// config ec leaf, rsa key: Certificate private key does not match the certificate
// config pss leaf, another pss key: Certificate private key does not match the certificate
// config ec leaf, other ec key: Certificate private key does not match the certificate

// PSS-restricted server keys; a key that is not the leaf's is refused.
